# ex22 — replicate spawn fixture (mirrors demos/5-generate/048-replicate-spawn.bqn; shared by ex23's twin)
# One entity world: rows 0-4 the spawner table (keys 0-4, rows 3-4 bystanders), rows 5-7 the nest table (keys 100-102).
# Fresh keys mint from 1+max live key = 103 in this concatenated layout (the .bqn's 5..9 remapped); parent stores world row ids, -1 sentinel on pre-existing rows.
n 8
col keys nat 0 1 2 3 4 100 101 102
col spawner bool 1 1 1 0 0 0 0 0
col count nat 2 0 3 0 0 0 0 0
col nest bool 0 0 0 0 0 1 1 1
col fertility nat 0 0 0 0 0 1 3 0
col minion bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col egg bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col parent int -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1
ja 生成器 spawner
ja 数 count
ja 手先 minion
ja 巣 nest
ja 肥沃 fertility
ja 卵 egg
ja 親 parent
